docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.review/codex-plan-r15.log:7648:docs/development/plan/plan-20260819.md:514:  - **统一入口 `MemoryRecordEnvelopeV1`（bridge、CLI `memory record`、进程内 API 共用）**：`{ schema_version, observation: TerminalObservationV1（必填）, proposal: Option<EpisodeProposalV1>, model_label: Option<String> }`；`observation` 必须先通过 plane/locator/digest 与 trust gate 校验，`proposal` 只是可選派生輸入；**proposal-only / 無 observation 的 envelope 一律拒絕**（穩定錯誤，不落庫、不建 job）。
