   541	| `<ID>` | `<Task type>` | `<行为轴>` | `<恢复动作>` | `<yes>` | `<yes>` | `<n/上限[@EX-ID]>` | `<n/上限[@EX-ID]>` | `<n>/<n>` | `<S/M/L-exception:EX-n>` | `<TASK-ID/DEP-ID/none>` | `<no-overlap/序列化于 ID>` | `<independent/batch-release child/batch-release point/family child/family release point/no-release>` | `<ID/N/A>` | `<EX-ID/N/A>` |
